  "releaseNotes": "Fix buffer ref counting in model attachments\n\n      - Ensure attached buffers have their reference count incremented in JsonModel and PacketModel,\n      and update LayoutModel.SetBuffer to safely dispose the previous buffer\n      and retain the new one only when the model owns the buffer (_parentOffset < 0).\n      - This prevents premature buffer release and improves pooled buffer lifetime management.",
